        <div id="Welcome" data-role="page" id="popup" data-url="popup" data-url="popup">
	        <div data-role="header" data-theme="d">
		        <h1>Back Order</h1>
	        </div><!-- /header -->

	        <div data-role="content" data-theme="d">
                <div style="margin:auto">
                    <img src="../../Content/images/BackOrders.jpg" style="width:300px; height="300px" />
                </div>
                <div>
                <h2> We need a response on your back orders.  Thanks. </h2>
                </div>

                <div>                    
	     	            <b> Back Orders </b> are items that are currently not available. <br /> <br />                        
                </div>

                <div>

                Please respond to this Back Order Response Application (BORA) on or before <span id="mbortAction"> </span> . <br /> <br />

                Please tell us what you want The Paper Tree to do with your Back Orders by clicking on the items on the following list.  <br /> <br /> 

                If you do not respond before this date and time elapses, our system will automatically 
                <span id="mbortRespond"> </span> . <br />

                </div>
                
                    <br /> <br />
			        <div style="text-align:center"> <a id="btnShowBackOrderList" href="#" data-role="button">Show Back Order List</a> </div>
	        </div> <!-- /content -->	
